WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.100
This diagram illustrates the Research Data
Lifecycle.

2
00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:08.500
It begins at the top with the foundational
phase, planning and preparing the

3
00:00:08.540 --> 00:00:11.380
data before any collection actually
starts.

4
00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:15.620
The cycle then moves downward into the
physical collection, organization,

5
00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:18.540
and initial processing of the research
materials.

6
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:23.860
Next comes the analyzing phase, where raw,
cleared data is subjected to formal

7
00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:26.400
examination and statistical evaluation.

8
00:00:26.840 --> 00:00:29.940
The results and the underlying data sets
then enter the stored data.

9
00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:34.980
and securing stage. Specific protocols
must be applied here to archive and

10
00:00:35.020 --> 00:00:38.480
protect the materials from loss or
unauthorized alteration.

11
00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:42.260
Finally, the loop closes with discovering
and reusing.

12
00:00:42.580 --> 00:00:46.540
The data must be actively curated so the
broader scientific community can

13
00:00:46.580 --> 00:00:49.520
access it and build upon the original
findings.

14
00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:54.920
A failure to rigorously document, manage,
or secure information at any single

15
00:00:54.960 --> 00:00:59.960
point in this continuous loop compromises
the validity of the entire study.
